<title>USA: Gibson to buy back up to one mln shares.</title>
<headline>Gibson to buy back up to one mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gibson Greetings Inc said Wednesday it will buy back up to one million shares of its common stock over the next 12 months.</p>
<p>The company, which had an average of 16.9 million shares outstanding during the quarter ended June 30, said it will buy the shares on the open market or in privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>It added it will use the repurchased shares for future stock options plans and for general corporate purposes.</p>
